napi-rs binding (`crates/rar-napi`)
-------------------------------------

The `smart-archive-rar` napi-rs binding under `crates/rar-napi` wraps the
`rar5` library for Node.js (native `.node` addons) and WASM
(`wasm32-wasip1-threads`). Its code, tests, and scripts originate from the
`smart-archive-rar` project (yjdyamv/smart-archive-rar) and remain
BSD-2-Clause. The napi-rs / emnapi machinery is third-party and carries its
own licenses. The binding does not ship via npm: compiled artifacts are
produced by CI and attached to GitHub Releases.

